*  151 - NEGATIVE DISCRIMINATOR.  ARBNO of INLINE FENCE (no *var
*  indirection) with seal-required backtrack 'aab'.  Currently PASSES
*  on csnobol4 — establishes that the bug requires *var indirection
*  of the FENCE pattern, not inline FENCE.  Any future FENCE fix must
*  keep this passing.
        s = 'aab'
        s POS(0) ARBNO(FENCE('a' | 'ab')) RPOS(0)             :S(BAD)F(GOOD)
BAD     OUTPUT = 'leak: inline FENCE ab alt retried'          :(END)
GOOD    OUTPUT = 'inline FENCE in ARBNO sealed'
END
